{"words": [{"text": "فَبِأَىِّ", "translation": "So which"}, {"text": "ءَالَآءِ", "translation": "(of the) favors"}, {"text": "رَبِّكُمَا", "translation": "(of) your Lord"}, {"text": "تُكَذِّبَانِ", "translation": "will you both deny"}], "sahih": "So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny?1"}